# What "export-ignore" leaves out is what ships in the composer dist Packagist
# builds. It does not decide the TER artefact: "tailor create-artefact" walks
# the checkout and filters it against a hardcoded list of its own, with no
# notion of this file, and what it produces is repacked by the TER on upload.
# The two therefore agree by review rather than by construction.
#
# The list is therefore only about *tracked* entries. ".Build", ".cache", "var",
# ".agent", ".idea", ".envrc" and "composer.lock" are git-ignored and never
# reach an archive to begin with, which is why none of them appears below.

/.editorconfig export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.php-cs-fixer.cache export-ignore
/Build export-ignore
/Tests export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/CONTRIBUTING.md export-ignore
/docs export-ignore
/AGENTS.md export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/GEMINI.md export-ignore

